WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:06.440
Farhana is a field officer in Kurigram, in northern Bangladesh.

2
00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:08.846
She visits community learning centres,

3
00:00:08.846 --> 00:00:12.582
where children keep learning when floods close the schools.

4
00:00:12.995 --> 00:00:14.944
Her phone opens on My tasks.

5
00:00:14.944 --> 00:00:18.633
Figures sent back to her come first, with the reason.

6
00:00:18.633 --> 00:00:22.253
Below them are the forms her M&E team has published.

7
00:00:22.692 --> 00:00:25.547
She has just visited the Ulipur bazar centre,

8
00:00:25.547 --> 00:00:28.338
so she opens the Learning centre visit form.

9
00:00:28.753 --> 00:00:31.158
Which centre, and the date of the visit.

10
00:00:32.839 --> 00:00:34.431
Children attending today.

11
00:00:34.431 --> 00:00:38.571
This answer feeds the indicator for pupils attending the centres.

12
00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:40.163
She counted them herself.

13
00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:45.045
The facilitator was there, and the children were reading from levelled readers.

14
00:00:45.477 --> 00:00:48.676
A photo of the session, as evidence for the number.

15
00:00:49.097 --> 00:00:50.694
Everything is answered.

16
00:00:50.694 --> 00:00:51.596
She sends it.

17
00:00:52.017 --> 00:00:55.906
Because she was signed in, the response becomes her own figure,

18
00:00:55.906 --> 00:00:57.388
with the photo attached.

19
00:00:57.388 --> 00:00:59.980
It is waiting on My tasks for her to send.

20
00:01:00.396 --> 00:01:03.052
She sends it on to her M&E officer.

21
00:01:03.489 --> 00:01:05.322
Now the figure that came back.

22
00:01:05.322 --> 00:01:09.111
Her girls' attendance rate for the third quarter was returned.

23
00:01:09.111 --> 00:01:11.617
Nadia wants the class registers attached.

24
00:01:12.041 --> 00:01:15.700
The correction page shows the reason, the figure as she sent it,

25
00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:17.015
and the comment thread.

26
00:01:17.445 --> 00:01:19.515
All schools have now reported.

27
00:01:19.515 --> 00:01:23.725
The final rate is ninety-one percent, counted, not estimated.

28
00:01:24.143 --> 00:01:27.574
She attaches a photo of the September class registers.

29
00:01:30.725 --> 00:01:34.384
And a short reply in the thread, so Nadia knows what changed.

30
00:01:38.704 --> 00:01:39.878
She sends it again.

31
00:01:39.878 --> 00:01:42.597
Nothing counts until a reviewer approves it,

32
00:01:42.597 --> 00:01:45.254
and the earlier round stays in the history.

33
00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:48.761
Under Sent, both figures are now waiting for review:

34
00:01:48.761 --> 00:01:53.014
the pupils figure from today's visit, and the corrected attendance rate.

35
00:01:53.421 --> 00:01:57.867
Fill the form, attach the proof, fix what was asked, and follow it through.

36
00:01:57.867 --> 00:01:58.993
All from one phone.
